WEBVTT

00:00:01.516 --> 00:00:03.238
Numbers lives under Inventory in the sidebar

00:00:03.238 --> 00:00:06.083
All Numbers lists every number in the workspace

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:09.135
Test numbers are for trial calls only

00:00:09.135 --> 00:00:12.433
A Spam chip marks a flagged number; hover for why

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:21.744
Tag numbers by team, region or purpose

00:00:21.744 --> 00:00:30.143
Filter by telephony account

00:00:30.143 --> 00:00:33.350
Number Pools groups numbers for rotation

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.647
WhatsApp Business numbers have their own tab
